@startuml
title Todo - Delete Todo (DELETE /api/todos/{todoId})
hide footbox
actor Client
participant TodoController
participant TodoService
participant TodoRepository
participant GlobalExceptionHandler as GEH

Client -> TodoController: DELETE /api/todos/{todoId}
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/todos/** requires role USER

TodoController -> TodoService: deleteTodo(principal.getUserId(), todoId)

TodoService -> TodoService: findOwnedTodoOrThrow(userId, todoId)
TodoService -> TodoRepository: findById(todoId)
TodoRepository --> TodoService: Optional<Todo>

alt Optional is empty (todo not found)
    TodoService --> TodoController: throw ResourceNotFoundException
    TodoController --> GEH: ResourceNotFoundException
    GEH --> Client: 404 Not Found
else Todo found
    alt !todo.getUser().getUserId().equals(userId) (not the owner)
        TodoService --> TodoController: throw ResourceNotFoundException (same message)
        TodoController --> GEH: ResourceNotFoundException
        GEH --> Client: 404 Not Found
    else Requester is the owner
        TodoService -> TodoRepository: delete(todo)
        TodoRepository --> TodoService: void
        TodoService --> TodoController: void
        TodoController --> Client: 204 No Content
    end
end
@enduml